<Paragraph>Hello Sheep Councillor {contact.firstName}!</Paragraph>
<Paragraph></Paragraph>
<Paragraph>We’ll see you on <Strong textColor="#6d28d9">Monday Aug 31, 9am PT.</Strong></Paragraph>
<Paragraph></Paragraph>
<Paragraph>This week we'll be talking about<Text textColor="#6d28d9"> code mode a</Text>nd what you can do with the new baml.reflect.* APIs, including how you can define tools at runtime!</Paragraph>
<Paragraph></Paragraph>
<Paragraph>BAML 0.18 is also now available, which means you and your agents can now <Code>baml query</Code> the BAML program traces saved on your computer.</Paragraph>
<Paragraph></Paragraph>
<Paragraph>If you're interested in seeing a demo, sharing feedback about your use case, or influencing how BAML does this, make sure to be there :)</Paragraph>
<Paragraph></Paragraph>
